{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Plotly chart\"\n",
        "execute:\n",
        "  warning: false\n",
        "  error: false\n",
        "  \n",
        "format:\n",
        "  html:\n",
        "    toc: true\n",
        "    toc-location: right\n",
        "    code-fold: show\n",
        "    code-tools: true\n",
        "    number-sections: true\n",
        "    code-block-bg: true\n",
        "    code-block-border-left: \"#31BAE9\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "![](images/Plotly-logo.png){width=\"650\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Plotly's Python graphing library makes interactive, publication-quality graphs. Examples of how to make line plots, scatter plots, area charts, bar charts, error bars, box plots, histograms, heatmaps, subplots, multiple-axes, polar charts, and bubble charts."
      ],
      "id": "d8372481"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import plotly\n",
        "print(plotly.__version__)"
      ],
      "id": "ed3badb2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "from plotnine import *\n",
        "import seaborn as sns\n",
        "import plotly.express as px\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "# Apply the default theme\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "# Load an example dataset\n",
        "tips = sns.load_dataset(\"tips\")\n",
        "tips.head()"
      ],
      "id": "84637114",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Scatter Plot"
      ],
      "id": "a1ebac86"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "f45b1ef0",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## color by group"
      ],
      "id": "a2bd09fd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\",color=\"sex\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "282fa89d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## size by group"
      ],
      "id": "ed47752e"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\",size=\"size\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "5625aacf",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# line Plot\n"
      ],
      "id": "a9f5351d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "dowjones= sns.load_dataset(\"dowjones\")\n",
        "dowjones.head()"
      ],
      "id": "0d5b91b9",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import plotly.express as px\n",
        "fig = px.line(dowjones, x=\"Date\", y=\"Price\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "caf13f08",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## color by group\n"
      ],
      "id": "177df950"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "import random\n",
        "#from siuba import _, mutate, filter, group_by, summarize,show_query\n",
        "#from siuba import *\n",
        "\n",
        "# Equivalent of: dowjones2 = dowjones >> mutate(type='old')\n",
        "dowjones2 = dowjones.copy()\n",
        "dowjones2['type'] = 'old'\n",
        "\n",
        "# Equivalent of: dowjones3 = dowjones >> mutate(Price=_.Price+random.random()*200, type='new')\n",
        "dowjones3 = dowjones.copy()\n",
        "dowjones3['Price'] = dowjones3['Price'] + random.random() * 200\n",
        "dowjones3['type'] = 'new'\n",
        "\n",
        "# Equivalent of: dowjones4 = pd.concat([dowjones2, dowjones3], ignore_index=True) >> arrange(_.Date)\n",
        "dowjones4 = pd.concat([dowjones2, dowjones3], ignore_index=True)\n",
        "dowjones4 = dowjones4.sort_values('Date').reset_index(drop=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "df = px.data.gapminder().query(\"continent=='Oceania'\")"
      ],
      "id": "76687cbd",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "dowjones4.head()"
      ],
      "id": "c48e060d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import plotly.express as px\n",
        "\n",
        "fig = px.line(dowjones4, x=\"Date\", y=\"Price\", color='type')\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "fd4d3f16",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# histogram"
      ],
      "id": "491c5837"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.histogram(tips, x=\"total_bill\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "454ceb49",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## color by group"
      ],
      "id": "d14e6488"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.histogram(tips, x=\"total_bill\", color='sex', barmode='group')\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "de7859ef",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# bar chart"
      ],
      "id": "8bb0939f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.bar(tips, x='sex', y='total_bill',color='sex')\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "8f35f84d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# box plot"
      ],
      "id": "405b303c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.box(tips, y=\"total_bill\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "c33927b2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## color by group"
      ],
      "id": "b890b90c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.box(tips, y=\"total_bill\",x='sex',color='sex')\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "6d421b18",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# strip plot"
      ],
      "id": "698a0cb5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.strip(tips,x=\"day\", y=\"total_bill\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "3e40054c",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## color by group"
      ],
      "id": "8c1de7bd"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.strip(tips,x=\"day\", y=\"total_bill\",color='sex')\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "190ff69d",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Facet plot\n"
      ],
      "id": "8dfda6ad"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips, x=\"total_bill\", y=\"tip\", color=\"sex\", facet_col=\"day\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "b755a3f2",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "make 3 plot per row"
      ],
      "id": "02e3e1e7"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips, x=\"total_bill\", y=\"tip\", color=\"sex\", facet_col=\"day\",facet_col_wrap=3)\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "8761afe8",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# title,size, x y names\n",
        "\n",
        "## add title\n"
      ],
      "id": "571ce85c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\", title=\"total_bill title\").update_layout(title_x=0.5)\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "69c7fb6f",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## adjust size"
      ],
      "id": "72bb1253"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\")\n",
        "\n",
        "fig.update_layout(\n",
        "    autosize=False\n",
        "    ,width=200\n",
        "    ,height=200\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    \n",
        "fig.show()\n"
      ],
      "id": "15ed8f22",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## change x y name\n"
      ],
      "id": "8ae4a7ad"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\"\n",
        "                ,labels={\n",
        "                     \"tip\": \"new x label)\",\n",
        "                     \"total_bill\": \"new y label\"\n",
        "                 }\n",
        "\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "    \n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "c2540087",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# applying themes:\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset .nav-pills}\n",
        "\n",
        "## ggplot2 themes"
      ],
      "id": "692a860f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\",template=\"ggplot2\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "fac94c58",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## seaborn themes"
      ],
      "id": "c1222448"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\",template=\"seaborn\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "30875d69",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## plotly_dark themes"
      ],
      "id": "bfadd87b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.scatter(tips,x=\"tip\", y=\"total_bill\",template=\"plotly_dark\")\n",
        "fig.show()"
      ],
      "id": "9a873906",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "# Save plot\n",
        "\n",
        "install package with pip install -U kaleido"
      ],
      "id": "07500d76"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig = px.line(df, x=\"year\", y=\"lifeExp\", title='Life expectancy in Canada')\n",
        "fig.write_image(\"yourfile.png\") "
      ],
      "id": "e4e19545",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Animation plot only \n",
        "\n",
        "https://plotly.com/python/animations/\n",
        "\n",
        "Although Plotly Express supports animation for many chart and map types, smooth inter-frame transitions are today only possible for scatter and bar\n"
      ],
      "id": "cc916d52"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import plotly.express as px\n",
        "df = px.data.gapminder()\n",
        "px.scatter(df, x=\"gdpPercap\", y=\"lifeExp\", animation_frame=\"year\", animation_group=\"country\",\n",
        "           size=\"pop\", color=\"continent\", hover_name=\"country\",\n",
        "           log_x=True, size_max=55, range_x=[100,100000], range_y=[25,90])"
      ],
      "id": "fbfdd667",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# reference:\n",
        "\n",
        "https://plotly.com/python/"
      ],
      "id": "73522cbe"
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "kernelspec": {
      "display_name": "Python 3",
      "language": "python",
      "name": "python3"
    }
  },
